        {
          "text": "Nebukadreza akanena, akasema, Na ahimidiwe Mungu wa Shadraka, na Meshaki, na Abednego; aliyemtuma malaika wake, akawaokoa watumishi wake waliomtumaini, wakaligeuza neno la mfalme, na kujitoa miili yao ili wasimtumikie mungu mwingine, wala kumwabudu, ila Mungu wao wenyewe. ",
